{"title":"우이 광선","artist":"Aiobahn +81","sourceId":"reference:VeXMugPLJIXsMZ4P7y2o","sourceHash":"bbcb71760b7936b37feae9bd7a14c46096dcc4623d6631368f1d7552bb7aa9d0","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":1.84,"end":4.41,"text":"「おい！おまえら天国行くぞ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":4.41,"end":6.57,"text":"真っ白なキャンパス並べて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":6.57,"end":9.57,"text":"オタクたちを集めた大きな船をだすぞ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":9.57,"end":12.29,"text":"がむしゃらに走らせたペンの先なぞって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":12.29,"end":15.29,"text":"死んじゃうぐらいに朝まで酔うぞ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":30.42,"end":33.42,"text":"労働を続けていても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.9,"end":36.9,"text":"つらいだけ　それじゃヤダもう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.33,"end":40.33,"text":"いまだけはここに居てもいいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":43.98,"end":46.98,"text":"苦しみの先にある業","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":47.54,"end":50.54,"text":"そんなものスパブロでGO(GO！)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":50.82,"end":53.82,"text":"楽園を　信じた先　往生","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":57.46,"end":60.46,"text":"あれる波　乗りこなせ愛のため","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":62.98,"end":65.97999999999999,"text":"ふざけてる　それでもいいじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":66.5,"end":69.5,"text":"埋まっていく　スケッチブック","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":70.78,"end":73.78,"text":"わかってる？今だけは踊ってな","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":76.53999999999999,"end":79.53999999999999,"text":"モニターの奥には居んじゃん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":80.02,"end":83.02,"text":"閉じ込めた最高の時間","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":84.87,"end":87.87,"text":"「まだまだ腰ふれ！届くぜ一億","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":88.66,"end":91.1,"text":"みんなで遊べば薄れる記憶","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":91.1,"end":94.1,"text":"長方形の中なら誰もがダンサー","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":94.38,"end":97.38,"text":"叫べおまえら　せーのっ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":97.86,"end":100.86,"text":"ボクたち毎日働く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":101.34,"end":104.34,"text":"少女を夢見て輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":104.78,"end":107.78,"text":"ボタンを押したら極楽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":108.14,"end":111.14,"text":"踊れば天国","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":124.86,"end":127.86,"text":"チャット欄へ放つボトルメール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":128.23,"end":131.23,"text":"オタクたちは　ういの夢見る　たすかる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":131.47,"end":134.47,"text":"溢れ出すコメント　忘れるなメメント","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":134.75,"end":137.75,"text":"どうせリアルは監獄　あなたとなら堕ちていく地獄","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":138.35,"end":141.35,"text":"宵越しのうたをキミと","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":142.11,"end":145.11,"text":"からやかな赤色ベレー帽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":145.43,"end":148.43,"text":"好きなだけ見つめてもいいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":152.03,"end":155.03,"text":"恋焦がれ高まる官能","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":155.54,"end":158.54,"text":"残念ね　お触りはNO(NO！)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":158.91,"end":161.91,"text":"制服の内に秘めた感情","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":165.67000000000002,"end":168.35,"text":"虹色つけたラブレター","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":168.35,"end":171.35,"text":"ヤギは読まずに食べた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":172.23,"end":174.95,"text":"マシュマロ　ふわり　隠した","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":174.95,"end":177.95,"text":"想い　告げずに　泣いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":178.51,"end":181.51,"text":"ドレミ　甘くて苦いモンスター","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":181.75,"end":184.75,"text":"黒い砂糖と飲んだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":184.95,"end":187.95,"text":"ソラシレ　さめない夜に流れた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":188.51,"end":191.51,"text":"季節外れの時雨に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":192.55,"end":195.51,"text":"「はいはい！みなさん注目してくださーい","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":195.51,"end":198.51,"text":"見えますか　逃避行の果てに広がる黄金のうい麦畑","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":199.79,"end":202.79,"text":"ああ　本当に大切なことなんだっけ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":203.27,"end":206.11,"text":"救済も楽園もきっとあるんだよ」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":206.11,"end":209.11,"text":"ボクたち毎日働く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":209.55,"end":212.55,"text":"少女を夢見て輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":212.99,"end":215.67000000000002,"text":"「忘れるな　この海は広大なダンスホール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":215.67000000000002,"end":217.61,"text":"光る指先　照らす行き先","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":217.61,"end":219.55,"text":"おまえら行くぞ　せーのっ　おー！」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":219.55,"end":222.55,"text":"他人からすれば出来の悪いシュール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":222.8,"end":225.8,"text":"それでも生きてる　一夜限りのアバンチュール","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":226.28,"end":229.28,"text":"やりすぎは即BAN　共に描くための画板","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":229.56,"end":232.56,"text":"ういが居れば怖くない孤独　あなたとなら堕ちていく地獄","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":233.07999999999998,"end":236.07999999999998,"text":"ボクたち毎日働く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":236.44,"end":239.44,"text":"少女を夢見て輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":239.96,"end":242.96,"text":"ボタンを押したら極楽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":243.04,"end":245.4,"text":"踊れば天国","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":245.4,"end":246.72,"text":"(もう一回！)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":246.72,"end":249.72,"text":"ボクたち毎日働く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":250.08,"end":253.08,"text":"少女を夢見て輝く","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":253.48,"end":256.48,"text":"ボタンを押したら極楽","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":256.84,"end":259.84,"text":"踊れば天国","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}